    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the helplines but they dont get it. they just give you a script. it's not just that im sad, it's like... the light is gone. i spent years pouring everything i had into him and it didn't even matter. i'm just empty. like there's nothing left of me to even try to \"reclaim.\" it feels so much more logical to just let go than to keep dragging this heavy thing around.\n Balance version emotional of the empty and the sense of logic.",
